SUMMARY:Matt Smith’s Well-Crafted Music Series with Jon Stickley\, Lyndsay Pruett and Christian Ferri
DESCRIPTION:Matt Smith’s Well-Crafted Music Series\nThe Well-Crafted Music Series is a weekly showcase curated by pedal steel guitarist Matt Smith\, bringing standout talent to Asheville through fresh\, genre-defying collaborations. Drawing from more than 20 years of touring and recording\, the series highlights artists Matt has met and worked with along the way\, creating one-of-a-kind performances you won’t see anywhere else. \nMay – October\, this series typically takes place on our scenic Meadow stage.  During cooler months\, Matt and friends will play in the Taproom. \nChairs\, blankets and well-behaved\, leashed pets are welcome in the Meadow. Please note that coolers and outside alcohol are not permitted on the premises.
URL:https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/matt-smiths-well-crafted-music-series-with-jon-stickley-lyndsay-pruett-and-christian-ferri/
LOCATION:Meadow at Highland Brewing Co.\, 12 Old Charlotte Highway\, Suite 200\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://highlandbrewing.com/wp-content/uploads/Untitled-design152.png
END:VEVENT
