SUMMARY:Flashback Band
DESCRIPTION:The Story of FLASHBACK BAND\nFLASHBACK BAND  started rockin’ away in April of 2016.  The Asheville based band jumped right into the local music scene and was received with great enthusiasm.Playing a variety of 80’s Arena Rock era tunes\, they became very popular with their fans and venues alike.  Engaging a repertoire of music covering bands like Journey\, Boston\, Van Halen\, Foreigner\, Bon Jovi\, Def Leppard and the like\,  They soon expanded to bring their high energy show to fans at many diverse venues which included\, Biltmore Estate\, Dollywood\, Sun Outdoors and the legendary House of Blues in Myrtle Beach.  Flashback Band became known for it’s energetic instrumentation and stunning vocals.  Weather you are looking for a private party\, wedding or just want to see a local show\, Flashback is the band for you! \nWeekend Live Music\nHighland Brewing’s weekend live music series showcases incredible local talent\, regional acts and national touring bands from across the East Coast and beyond. Free and open to all ages (unless noted otherwise)\, it’s the perfect excuse to gather your crew\, listen and vibe to a wide range of genres including soul\, bluegrass\, acoustic\, country\, folk and more.\nLive music typically takes place on our scenic Meadow stage. Shows are rain or shine\, if the weather doesn’t cooperate and we have time to move inside\, the band will play in the Taproom where there’s still plenty of room to boogie.\nChairs\, blankets and well-behaved\, leashed pets are welcome in the Meadow. Please note that coolers and outside alcohol are not permitted on the premises. \n 
URL:https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/flashback-band/
LOCATION:Meadow at Highland Brewing Co.\, 12 Old Charlotte Highway\, Suite 200\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://highlandbrewing.com/wp-content/uploads/MicrosoftTeams-image-6.jpeg
END:VEVENT
