SUMMARY:The Moon and You
DESCRIPTION:Bio\nAt its core\, The Moon and You is a charismatic husband-and-wife team. Melissa Hyman plays cello\, Ryan Furstenberg plays guitar and banjo\, and both sing in “voices that sound like they were made for one another” (Bill DeYoung\, Connect Savannah). But whatever you might assume based on their gorgeous vocal blend and heartfelt lyrics\, this ain’t your basic folk duo. With a rotating cast of talented friends to add unexpected instrumentation to their lineup\, The Moon and You never plays the same show twice. This ever-evolving\, expandable and collapsible model leaves the band constantly reinventing itself in ways both surprising and satisfying. \nWeekend Live Music\nHighland Brewing’s weekend live music series showcases incredible local talent\, regional acts and national touring bands from across the East Coast and beyond. Free and open to all ages (unless noted otherwise)\, it’s the perfect excuse to gather your crew\, listen and vibe to a wide range of genres including soul\, bluegrass\, acoustic\, country\, folk and more.\nLive music typically takes place on our scenic Meadow stage. Shows are rain or shine\, if the weather doesn’t cooperate and we have time to move inside\, the band will play in the Taproom where there’s still plenty of room to boogie.\nChairs\, blankets and well-behaved\, leashed pets are welcome in the Meadow. Please note that coolers and outside alcohol are not permitted on the premises. \n 
URL:https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/the-moon-and-you/
CATEGORIES:Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://highlandbrewing.com/wp-content/uploads/The-Moon-and-You-Pic.png
END:VEVENT
